\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {I}{\ignorespaces Comparative analysis on one harness (corrected data, 3 origins $\times $ 3 seeds). Mean validation / test RMSE in weekly cases. Top: the five published ST-GNNs and the LSTM of SEIR-LSTM, as published (direct head), with PAGE{}, and with PAGE{} plus the SEIR branch (the SEIR-GNN, or SEIR-LSTM for the LSTM). Squared error, no seasonal features. Bottom: baselines; $B$ is the configuration validation selects. Selection uses validation only.}}{1}{table.1}\protected@file@percent }
